# Pairs with TypeOK. An abandoned run charges the fault budget twice and leaves it
# outside its bound.
MODULE: TypeOkAbandonOverspendsFaults
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an abandoned run overspends the fault budget
PERTURBS: Abandon
BOUNDS: MaxFaults = 1

--- FIND
    /\ touched' = [touched EXCEPT ![p] = {}]
    /\ faults' = faults + 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: charged twice.
    /\ touched' = [touched EXCEPT ![p] = {}]
    /\ faults' = faults + 2
--- END
